### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Register User Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login User (Token Otomatis Disimpan ke Variable)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Profile User (Protected - Wajib Login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Update Profile User (Protected - Wajib Login)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso Updated",
  "email": "budi.new@gmail.com"
}

### 5. Test Uji Validasi Register (Error 400 - Email & Password Salah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "email-salah",
  "password": "123"
}

### 6. Test Uji Akses Tanpa Token (Error 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me